/* Writer Tools — fully digital procedural glyph synthesis. No drawing/scanning required.
 * Builds stroke skeletons from concept/sound identities, turns them into closed outlines,
 * applies medium/style/evolution effects, derives metrics/variants and feeds the existing TTF writer.
